issue_body:
It would be useful to alter the `tinySetup(config)` function.

Maybe add a (PHP)-hook somewhere to assign a JS-variable: `tinyMceOverrides` so one can do something like this:


    function hookTinyMceConfigDefault(&$config){
          $config['toolbar1' = "code,colorpicker,bold,italic,underline,strikethrough,blockquote,link,align,bullist,numlist,table,image,media,mysuperspecialtoolbarmagictrick";
    }


Then in `js/admin/tinymce.inc.php`  something like:

    
      $.each(tinyMceOverrides, function (index, el) {
           config[index] = el;
       });
